  "text": "### Interest Calculation  \n**Example:**\n- Balance: £10,000\n- Rate: 4.50% AER\n- Days in month: 30\n- Daily rate: 4.50% ÷ 365 = 0.01233%\n- Interest: £10,000 × 0.01233% × 30 = £36.99  \n**Monthly Interest Payment:**\n- Calculated daily based on balance\n- Paid on the last business day of month\n- Added directly to account\n- Doesn't require action from customer",
